Z||000000||fierodave||10-22-2000||12:14 AM||||<BR>OK  I have a final deal on the sale of that IMSA I purchased last week <P>It includes the restoration of that car!  <BR>The color choice is between red and white so far!  <P>I will have resto pic's of the car as the work taks place  and before it gets shipped out to sunny Cal.<P>I do have a few items that I will be needing for this project though! <P>I am looking for one of those wale tail spoilers that gets glassed onto the trunk lid!  <P>If anyone has a used one in great condition or could steer me to a new one,  the help would be greatly appreciated.<P>maybe a set of nice rims to fit the monster rear and front wheel wells too!  <P>I do know the owner will be selling the wood dash kit from it,  and the gray cloth speaker seat covers that are in real nice condition.  <P>Remember this is a kit on the 85 GT chassis<BR>So with that~~the work will be started as of monday!<P>Thanks to all that inquired on the sale of this car.  <P>There are  many many more exciting sales coming up real SOON (weeks)  so stay tuned!<P>If you have any of the Imsa stuff I need,  please email me directly. <P>because of my upcoming adventure out west, I may not be able to follow this post like I should.<BR>Thanks for the space <P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://members.theglobe.com/fierodave/gifs/fierosig.gif">  <p>[This message has been edited by fierodave (edited 10-22-2000).]||||reg||14
